t(19, 2075, """A month ago, or a little more or less, I wrote a post here whose subject was: there are still those in our poor Arab countries who dream of the illusions of emigrating to America and think the world has enough time left for them to live there for 200 years and 1000 years. The news: Trump halts immigration to the United States permanently, not temporarily. This is a wake-up blow to the consciousness of the Muslim Arab and the Muslim non-Arab. A blow that may perhaps be of benefit! Perhaps it will make things clear to those who have refused to understand for decades, not years! Decades in which we have been trying to explain, and the answer was always the refusal to understand.""")

